# Build output and coverage profiles are per-machine.
target
coverage
# The lockfile is per-machine too: this crate ships nothing, so pinning its
# external dependencies buys nothing and only creates merge conflicts.
Cargo.lock
# `corpus/` and `artifacts/` are deliberately NOT ignored. The phase-2 gate is
# stated in terms of "a seeded corpus" (ROADMAP.md §13), so the seeds are part
# of the repo; libFuzzer's own additions to the corpus should be committed only
# when they are minimised and add real coverage.
